@startuml
title 8.4 Deactivate Pro Plan - sequence diagram
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBorderColor #444444
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor Admin as U
participant "View" as V <<View>> #EADCFF
participant AdminShopPlanController as C <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant ShopPlanService as S <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant UserRepository as UR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant ShopPlanRepository as PR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9

== A. Stop selling a plan ==
U -> V : click "Xóa / ngừng bán" on an enabled plan
V -> V : confirm dialog "Ngừng bán gói" (cancel sends nothing)
V -> C : DELETE /api/admin/shop-plans/{id}
C -> C : @PreAuthorize hasRole('ADMIN')
C -> S : removePlan(adminId, id)
S -> UR : findByIdAndRoleAndStatus(adminId, ADMIN, ACTIVE)
alt not an active admin
  S --> C : 403 "Chỉ admin đang hoạt động được kích hoạt Pro."
else admin
  alt id = "FREE"
    S --> C : 409 "Không thể xóa gói Free."
  else another plan
    S -> PR : findLocked(id) (row lock)
    alt plan not found
      PR --> S : empty
      S --> C : 404 "Không tìm thấy gói, cửa hàng hoặc giao dịch thuộc quyền truy cập."
    else found
      S -> S : enabled = false (row kept)
      S --> C : void
      C --> V : 200 OK (empty body)
      V -> V : reload the list, row shows "Ngừng bán"
      V --> U : plan is marked "Ngừng bán", can be re-enabled by editing (8.3)
    end
  end
end

== B. Effect on shops ==
note over S
  Plan list (8.1) no longer returns the plan.
  checkout() (8.6) and adminGrant() (8.8) filter enabled plans, so a new purchase or grant gets 404.
end note
note over S
  Shops already on the plan keep endsAt and their limits. Pending
  SePay invoices for it still reconcile, because reconcile() does not check enabled.
end note

@enduml
